    "04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-heading-1": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Acoustic Booths & Office Pods for Modern Workspaces"
          }
        },
        "template--16816299114721__04e915ad-dc54-4882-8c19-69a67c786f0b-text-1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>Welcome to Soundbox’s collection of <strong>Acoustic Booth</strong>, <strong>Acoustic Pod</strong> and <strong>Office Booth</strong> solutions – expertly designed to bring privacy, focus and flexibility to today’s workplaces. Whether you’re upgrading a corporate office, fitting out a co-working space or supporting hybrid teams, our range of <strong>Meeting Booth</strong>, <strong>Meeting Pod</strong>, <strong>Private Office Booth</strong> and <strong>Soundproof Booth</strong> options creates enclosed, distraction-free environments built for modern working.</p><h2>Why Choose a Soundbox Acoustic Booth or Office Pod?</h2><h3>Improved Focus & Productivity</h3><p>Open-plan offices are known for noise and constant interruptions. A dedicated <strong>Office Pod</strong> or <strong>Meeting Booth</strong> provides a quiet, contained space for calls, video conferences and focused work – helping employees stay productive throughout the day.</p><h3>Exceptional Acoustic Performance</h3><p>Every <strong>Soundproof Booth</strong> and <strong>Soundproof Pod</strong> is constructed with high-performance acoustic panels, precision seals and insulated structures to minimise sound transfer. Conversations stay private, background noise is reduced, and teams can work without disruption.</p><h3>Fast Installation & Flexible Design</h3><p>Our modular <strong>Acoustic Pod</strong> and <strong>Office Booth</strong> systems are designed for quick assembly with minimal disruption. They can also be relocated as your workspace evolves, making them ideal for growing businesses and agile environments.</p><h3>Designed for Comfort</h3><p>Each <strong>Private Office Booth</strong> and <strong>Meeting Pod</strong> features integrated ventilation, comfortable seating options and energy-efficient LED lighting. The result is a calm, well-lit environment that supports wellbeing as well as productivity.</p><h2>A Complete Range of Acoustic Booth & Meeting Pod Solutions</h2><p>We offer a versatile selection of workplace pods to suit every requirement:</p><ul><li><br/><strong>Single Acoustic Booth</strong> – Ideal for confidential calls, virtual meetings and deep-focus tasks.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Meeting Booth for Two</strong> – Compact, private spaces for one-to-ones and interviews.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Larger Meeting Pod Options</strong> – Designed for small team collaboration without disturbing the wider office.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Private Office Booth Models</strong> – A fully enclosed personal workspace within an open-plan setting.<br/></li></ul><p>Each <strong>Office Pod</strong> is available with customisable finishes, glazing options and acoustic ratings to match your interior design and performance needs.</p><h2>What Sets Our Soundproof Booths Apart?</h2><h3>Proven Acoustic Engineering</h3><p>Our <strong>Acoustic Booth</strong> and <strong>Soundproof Pod</strong> models are independently tested to recognised standards, including ISO 23351-1, ensuring reliable and measurable sound reduction.</p><h3>Technology-Ready Interiors</h3><p>Integrated power sockets, USB charging points and data connectivity come as standard in many of our <strong>Meeting Booth</strong> and <strong>Office Pod</strong> designs, supporting seamless digital working.</p><h3>Contemporary, Professional Aesthetics</h3><p>Sleek lines, premium materials and refined finishes allow every <strong>Acoustic Pod</strong> to complement modern office interiors while maintaining a professional appearance.</p><h3>Sustainable Construction</h3><p>We prioritise responsibly sourced materials, recyclable components and energy-efficient lighting to reduce environmental impact across our <strong>Office Booth</strong> collection.</p><h3>Modular & Relocatable</h3><p>Many of our <strong>Meeting Pod</strong> and <strong>Soundproof Booth</strong> solutions are designed with mobility in mind, allowing for repositioning as your layout changes.</p><h2>Making the Most of Your Acoustic Pod Investment</h2><ul><li><br/><strong>Position Strategically</strong> – Place your <strong>Meeting Booth</strong> or <strong>Office Pod</strong> near collaborative areas but away from high-traffic walkways.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Define Clear Usage</strong> – Allocate each <strong>Acoustic Booth</strong> as a call booth, video conferencing space or deep-work zone to maximise effectiveness.<br/></li><li><br/><strong>Engage Your Team</strong> – Gather feedback to refine placement and ensure your <strong>Private Office Booth</strong> solutions are used consistently.<br/></li></ul><h2>The Office Booth Advantage</h2><p>Studies suggest that excessive noise in open-plan offices can significantly reduce productivity and increase stress levels. Installing a <strong>Soundproof Booth</strong> or <strong>Acoustic Pod</strong> provides an immediate solution – restoring privacy, enhancing concentration and creating dedicated zones for communication and focused work.</p><p>A well-placed <strong>Meeting Pod</strong> or <strong>Office Booth</strong> not only improves day-to-day efficiency but also demonstrates a commitment to employee wellbeing and professional workspace design.</p><h2>Explore Our Acoustic Booth & Office Pod Collection</h2><p>If you’re looking for a high-quality <strong>Acoustic Booth</strong>, <strong>Meeting Booth</strong>, <strong>Office Pod</strong> or <strong>Soundproof Pod</strong>, Soundbox offers solutions to suit businesses of all sizes. Browse our collection to compare specifications, finishes and acoustic performance levels.</p><p>Ready to transform your workspace? Explore the range today or contact our team for expert guidance on selecting the right <strong>Private Office Booth</strong> or <strong>Meeting Pod</strong> for your environment.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
